      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMIE'S BRIDE (6) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind George Judy (17.41) in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Sure to be about the mark. GOLDEN SUNSET (3) missed the frame last time when fifth (17.89) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Has ability and can atone. BLUE MAJESTIC (1) was out of the placings last time when fifth at this track (17.83) but scored four back at this track (17.55). Solid record here at the distance winning seven races. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. STOLE MY BONE (2) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
